(7664766, 1250315, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. I think I''d like to see a bit more detail on the cliffs and rocks.</td>', 'Interesting scene. I think I''d like to see a bit more detail on the cliffs and rocks.', '2020-06-01 11:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
