(7665142, 1250208, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great textures, contrasts, composition and lines. Love it.</td>', 'Great textures, contrasts, composition and lines. Love it.', '2020-06-04 04:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7665143, 1250024, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great shapes and composition. I wish the reflection/highlights were more clean, without the reverse V shape in the reflection on the glass. (best way to achieve: have a clean white area in the background just outside camera view, surrounding the current black area, and then shield of everything else)</td>', 'Great shapes and composition. I wish the reflection/highlights were more clean, without the reverse V shape in the reflection on the glass. (best way to achieve: have a clean white area in the background just outside camera view, surrounding the current black area, and then shield of everything else)', '2020-06-04 04:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7665144, 1250316, 4008, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. She looks very awake and bright. To me it feels a bit unnatural that there is a large depth of field but her nose, cheeks and chin seem out of focus. Maybe should have moved focus a bit more to the front or use a more narrow depth of field?</td>', 'Lovely portrait. She looks very awake and bright. To me it feels a bit unnatural that there is a large depth of field but her nose, cheeks and chin seem out of focus. Maybe should have moved focus a bit more to the front or use a more narrow depth of field?', '2020-06-04 04:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
