(7665573, 1250242, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, and in the fluidity of time we were mere inches apart.  Talking about my photo, "A Day In The Life," which was south to your north, my back to the Bethesda Fountain.  Where''s the water, the water lilies, the lotuses?  The pigeons on the angel''s wings?  A  lovely part of Central Park, and your image reverberates with all that isn''t now but will be again.</td>', 'Yes, and in the fluidity of time we were mere inches apart.  Talking about my photo, "A Day In The Life," which was south to your north, my back to the Bethesda Fountain.  Where''s the water, the water lilies, the lotuses?  The pigeons on the angel''s wings?  A  lovely part of Central Park, and your image reverberates with all that isn''t now but will be again.', '2020-06-08 01:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
