(7665580, 1250316, 70896, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> splendid. (I do, however, find the title a bit patronising). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>By no means did I mean to be patronizing, full apologies if I was! So many times someone has asked me how old my grandma is, and when I say 93 they immediately assume she''s frail, or sick or who knows what. It makes me mad when people do that. This lady has more spark than a lot of people I know, young and old, and a better sense of humor too! :P</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: splendid. (I do, however, find the title a bit patronising).   By no means did I mean to be patronizing, full apologies if I was! So many times someone has asked me how old my grandma is, and when I say 93 they immediately assume she''s frail, or sick or who knows what. It makes me mad when people do that. This lady has more spark than a lot of people I know, young and old, and a better sense of humor too! :P', '2020-06-08 01:47:51.000000', NULL, 0),
